# Normalize all text files to LF inside the repository.
# Without this, Windows editors and tooling rewrite files with CRLF endings,
# which makes git report every line of a file as changed even when the
# content is identical. See CLAUDE.md for the scheduled-run git workflow.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never convert line endings.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
